Bundled third-party files
-------------------------

These files are included so the book's exercises can run. They remain under
their own terms:

chapter06/jython-standalone-2.7.2.jar
    Jython 2.7.2, https://www.jython.org
    Jython License (PSF-style) and the licenses of its bundled components;
    see LICENSE and META-INF/ inside the JAR.

chapter08/pyWinhook-1.6.2-cp38-cp38-win_amd64.whl
    pyWinhook 1.6.2, https://github.com/Tungsteno74/pyWinhook
    MIT License.

chapter02/test_rsa.key
    RSA private key from Paramiko's public test suite
    (tests/_support/rsa.key at https://github.com/paramiko/paramiko).
    It is published test data, not a secret, and must never be used to
    protect anything real.

chapter05/all.txt, chapter05/cain.txt
    Wordlists used by the book's brute-forcing exercises.

chapter10/bhvulnservice.zip, chapter11/cmeasure.bin, chapter07/config/
    Exercise material accompanying the book.
